---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="AIA-Accredited Code & Permit Education" description="Burnham Nationwide and The Code Group offer webinars, on-demand classes and private training on code consulting, ADA accessibility and building compliance. Earn AIA/HSW LU credits." nav="learn">
  <div class="page-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>Learn</li><li>Continuing education</li></ol>
      <nav aria-label="On this page"><a href="#webinars">Webinars</a><a href="#on-demand">On-demand classes</a><a href="#private-training">Private training</a><a href="#instructors">Instructors</a></nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Continuing education</div>
        <h1 class="h-display">Code and permit education from the people who <span class="hl-block">do the work.</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">Webinars, on-demand classes and private training from The Code Group at Burnham, covering building codes, accessibility and compliance. Courses carry AIA/HSW learning unit credits.</p>
        <div class="row">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#on-demand">Browse on-demand classes</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="#private-training">Book private training</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/img/learn/event-1.jpg" alt="Architects reviewing drawings pinned to a gallery wall at an industry event"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted" id="webinars">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
      <div class="stack stack--sm">
        <div class="eyebrow">Upcoming webinars</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Live sessions hosted by The Code Group.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Register for upcoming webinars and earn credit while you learn.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="callout">
        <div class="callout__title">Schedule</div>
        <div class="callout__body">No webinars are scheduled right now. Check back soon, or <a class="link" href="/contact/">contact us</a> to hear about the next session.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="on-demand">
    <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
      <div class="stack stack--sm section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">On-demand classes</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Learn on your schedule from accredited Burnham professionals.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" style="--min: 260px;">
        <article class="card">
          <span class="chip">Building codes</span>
          <h3 class="h-sm">How building codes impact the design and construction process</h3>
          <p class="small">Presenter: Christopher Chwedyk, AIA, CSI, NCARB</p>
          <div class="card__foot"><a class="link" href="https://www.lorman.com/training/construction/international-building-codes?discount_code=T4947885&amp;p=18650&amp;siteID=je6NUbpObpQ-YTgZJuzG9URudQ8M.9.srA&amp;ranMID=42847&amp;ranEAID=je6NUbpObpQ&amp;ranSiteID=je6NUbpObpQ-YTgZJuzG9URudQ8M.9.srA">View class</a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="chip">Specifications</span>
          <h3 class="h-sm">Code compliance responsibilities and how to build them into project specifications</h3>
          <p class="small">Presenter: Christopher Chwedyk, AIA, CSI, NCARB. Presented October 4, 2023.</p>
          <div class="card__foot"><a class="link" href="https://www.lorman.com/training/construction/building-code-compliance-specifications?p=18650&amp;siteID=je6NUbpObpQ-Y8vo.MHqp6Uvx9IB85AcHw&amp;ranMID=42847&amp;ranEAID=je6NUbpObpQ&amp;ranSiteID=je6NUbpObpQ-Y8vo.MHqp6Uvx9IB85AcHw">View class</a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="chip">Accessibility</span>
          <h3 class="h-sm">Multi-family residential: key accessibility components of Fair Housing and IBC/ICC A117.1-2009</h3>
          <p class="small">Presenter: Leah Riley, ADA Specialist and Associate Director of The Code Group at Burnham. Presented October 11, 2023.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <span class="chip">Accessibility</span>
          <h3 class="h-sm">Dealing with accessibility standards that conflict or don’t exist</h3>
          <p class="small">Presenter: Leah Riley, ADA Specialist and Associate Director of The Code Group at Burnham</p>
          <div class="card__foot"><a class="link" href="https://www.lorman.com/training/engineering/conflicting-and-non-existent-accessibility-standards">View class</a></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark" id="private-training">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Private code training</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">A session built for your team, department or firm.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Bring Burnham’s expert-led code classes to your team in a private, customized session. Tailor the content to your firm’s specialties or align it with a specific project.</p>
        <ul class="learn-points">
          <li>Flexible topics</li>
          <li>Flexible pricing</li>
          <li>Focused entirely on your team</li>
        </ul>
        <div><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Contact us to get started</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/img/learn/class-1.jpg" alt="Burnham’s Chicago office, with a Burnham-branded stress ball on a desk in the foreground" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="instructors">
    <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
      <div class="stack stack--sm section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Your instructors</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Burnham Nationwide and The Code Group.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid--2">
        <div class="stack stack--sm">
          <h3 class="h-card">Burnham Nationwide</h3>
          <p class="body">Since 1992, Burnham Nationwide has guided thousands of projects, from new skyscrapers to historic renovations, through permits and regulations. Our permit expediters and code consultants work for clients ranging from major corporations to leading developers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack stack--sm">
          <h3 class="h-card">The Code Group</h3>
          <p class="body">The Code Group, a subsidiary of Burnham Nationwide established in 2001, is our team of code experts and licensed architects. Its members serve on national and municipal code committees and bring deep knowledge of building, accessibility, electrical, mechanical and fire safety codes, which they share through workshops, seminars and accredited courses.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats stats--light">
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat__value">1992</div><div class="stat__label">year Burnham was founded</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat__value">3,000+</div><div class="stat__label">cities served across the US</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat__value">100,000+</div><div class="stat__label">building permits secured</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
      <div class="stack stack--sm">
        <div class="eyebrow">Why it matters</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Codes change. Your knowledge should keep pace.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="body">Architects, builders, engineers and code compliance professionals have to keep up with changing building codes, safety standards and best practices. Regular training keeps licenses and certifications current, including AIA continuing education requirements, and builds the practical knowledge that delivers safer, code-compliant projects.</p>
        <p class="body">Burnham supports that development with accredited courses that help our peers grow their expertise.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap cta-block">
      <div class="stack stack--sm">
        <h2>Want a class for your team?</h2>
        <p>Tell us your firm’s focus and we’ll design a session around it.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
